{
 "encounter_id": "00607",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hot one out there today. Took me twenty minutes to find a park."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Always the way on Thursdays. Council's got half the street dug up. Come in, sit down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, the note says scalp trouble. What's going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Itchy scalp. Since I dyed my hair."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long ago was the dye?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five days ago. Box dye, a darker brown. Got it at the chemist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Had you used that brand before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Different brand. First time with this one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did the itch start, relative to the dye?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The day after the dye. Got worse by the weekend."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Describe the itch for me. Is it constant?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pretty constant. Worse in hot showers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else going on up there? Burning, stinging, anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A burning feeling along the front, yeah."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any skin changes you can see or feel?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Flaking. Bits come off when I scratch. And redness along my hairline."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mm. Any swelling around the eyes or lips?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever or feeling hot and shivery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rash anywhere else on your body, arms, neck, chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not at all. Just the head."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now, do you have any health conditions I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure. Asthma. And migraines, but they're pretty rare."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medicines for those?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril, 5 mg once a day, for my blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And for the asthma?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ventolin puffer. When I need it. Not often."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines or anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix out, about ten years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any others?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils. As a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family history of skin problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum's got psoriasis. Mostly on her elbows."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm an electrician. Lots of time in a hard hat, if that matters."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It might, actually. Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never smoked in my life."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A couple of beers on the weekend. That's it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gym three times a week. Sweat a lot under the helmet, too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely, thanks. Let me check your vitals. Blood pressure 138 over 86. Pulse 76. Temperature 36.8. Oxygen 99 percent. Weight 84 kilos.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pressure high?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A touch up, nothing to worry about today. How's your breathing, by the way, any problems with the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now let's have a look at the scalp. Part your hair for me, chin down.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your scalp is red and flaky along the front hairline.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, I can feel that bit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are small crusted spots behind both ears as well.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I hadn't seen those."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I can't feel any swollen glands in your neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So what I'm thinking. This could be a reaction to the dye, a contact dermatitis. But I can't rule out a flare of dermatitis from the helmet and sweat, or even psoriasis, given your mum."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Not just the dye, then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly not. Hard to say from looking alone, so we'll test it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What tests?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to do a skin scraping today, and the nurse will take it on the way out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll also do a swab of the crusted spots, to check for infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to book a patch test, to see exactly what your skin reacts to. The clinic will call you with a date."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long does that take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few visits across a week. Until then, no more dye, and use a gentle shampoo. Lukewarm water, not hot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Easy. I'll skip the dye."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come back next Thursday and we'll go over the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Next Thursday. Righto. Hopefully a park too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ha, good luck with that. See you then."
  }
 ],
